    "provide-a-brief-description-of-the-project": "BLOOM is a nonprofit. Our tools are free. We work with civic leaders to run public conversations that go beyond talk: surfacing what communities actually think, finding real common ground, and connecting findings to the decisions that matter.\n\nThree things make it work:\n\n**CivicOS**\nA free, open-source platform that supports the full problem solving processes — from setting the agenda to reporting what was heard\n\n**Civic Hosts**\nA network of trained community leaders who run and steward local deliberations\n\n**Headline Deliberations**\nLarge-scale pilots led by place-based civic partners, with BLOOM support, that demonstrate what’s possible and develop the model\n",
